==Lodgy Glace==
[[File:Dacia Lodgy glace.jpg|right|thumb|Lodgy Glace]]
In November 2011, Dacia announced that it would take part in the [[Andros Trophy]], revealing the new Lodgy for the first time, in an [[ice racing]] version called Lodgy Glace. Unlike the production version, the Lodgy Glace featured a rear [[mid-engine, four-wheel-drive layout]] and was powered by a 3.0 litre [[V6 engine|V6]] engine, which produced {{convert|355|bhp|kW PS|0|abbr=on}} and {{convert|265|lbft|Nm|0|abbr=on}} of torque.

Two models were raced by father and son [[Alain Prost]] and [[Nicolas Prost]], and the third by [[Evens Stievenart]].<ref>{{cite web|title=Dacia Lodgy ice racer shown|url=http://www.autocar.co.uk/News/NewsArticle/AllCars/260066/|publisher=Autocar|access-date=6 January 2012|date=14 November 2011}}</ref> The team eventually won the competition, with Alain Prost as the first placed driver, gaining four victories and six other podium finishes.

The seven rounds took place in [[Val Thorens]], [[Andorra]], [[Alpe d'Huez]], [[Isola 2000]], [[Lans-en-Vercors]], [[Saint-Dié-des-Vosges]] and [[Super Besse]].<ref>{{cite web|title=Rapports de courses - Trophée Andros|url=http://www.dacia.fr/univers-dacia/evenements/trophee-andros/rapports-de-courses/|publisher=Dacia France|access-date=14 August 2013|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20130206053158/http://www.dacia.fr/univers-dacia/evenements/trophee-andros/rapports-de-courses/|archive-date=6 February 2013|url-status=dead}}</ref> It was the first MPV model to win the competition,<ref>{{cite web|title=Prost și Dacia Lodgy "Glace" încununați de succes la Trofeul Andros!|url=http://www.daciagroup.com/presa/comunicate-de-presa/2012/prost-si-dacia-lodgy-glace-incununati-de-succes-la-trofeul-andros|publisher=Dacia|access-date=14 August 2013|date=30 January 2012}}</ref> and the second model from Dacia to compete in the Andros Trophy, after the [[Dacia Duster|Duster]] took part in the seasons of 2010 and 2011.<ref>{{cite web|title=Dacia Lodgy "Glace": o masina deosebita si un sezon deosebit la Trofeul Andros|url=http://www.daciagroup.com/presa/comunicate-de-presa/2011/dacia-lodgy-glace-o-masina-deosebita-si-un-sezon-deosebit-la-trofeul|publisher=Dacia|access-date=13 August 2013|date=14 November 2011}}</ref>

